msgid "当前平台交付边界"
msgstr "Current platform delivery boundaries"

msgid "当前重构将生产 SoC 收敛为 STM32F4，现有 F407VE／ZG 及四个 Board 包迁入系列入口。 全部 vendor 来源保留；Native 移到显式测试支撑。应用任务、产品策略和私有 PCB 继续由外部工程维护。"
msgstr "The current refactor narrows production SoCs to STM32F4 and moves existing F407VE/ZG implementations and four Board packages into the series entry point. All vendor sources are retained; Native moves to explicit test support. Application tasks, product policies and private PCBs remain in external projects."

msgid "本页说明当前阅读与验收入口，不把源码存在、文档构建或历史软件结果写成本次通过。 默认 F407 路径的启动、停止、失败回滚、共享资源及诊断已由手写 C 维护，生成器负责 静态连接。后续主线是精确 F4 型号扩展、所需运行期能力和真实测量，按实际回归与源码 身份验收。当前物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`，本次重构没有自动建立软件候选。"
msgstr "This page identifies current reading and acceptance entry points. Source presence, documentation builds and historical software results are not recorded as passes for this iteration. The default F407 startup, stop, failure rollback, shared resources and diagnostics are maintained in handwritten C; the generator provides static connections. Further work covers exact F4 parts, required runtime capabilities and physical measurements, accepted against actual regressions and source identity. Physical HIL remains `not_executed`; this refactor creates no software candidate automatically."

msgid "主机配置统一由 `tools/configure/` 维护；配置代码不进入 MCU 镜像。"
msgstr "Host configuration is maintained in `tools/configure/`; its code is not linked into the MCU image."

