msgstr "Existing foundations, implementation increments and exit criteria for WP01–WP12 and IO01–IO20"

msgid "[本批变更与验证](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/61)"
msgstr "[Current changes and verification](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/61)"

msgid "PR #61 的源码与实际执行记录；后续增量不继承基线资格"
msgstr "PR #61 source and actual execution records; later increments do not inherit baseline qualification"

msgid "本轮架构迭代以固定源码 [`a2b74d82`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/a2b74d826dc1545aa8f51b5fcbc05fcd1cc2c984) 为既有基础。该版本已有的流式传输、恢复和勘误修正，与本轮工作包新增内容分别记录。 PR、目录或公共接口存在不等于工作包完成；当前实施仍须取得对应源码的测试、ARM、 资源、SDK 与文档结果。实板和远端 Actions 按用户要求暂缓，软件验收使用本地门禁。"
msgstr "This architecture iteration uses fixed source [`a2b74d82`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/a2b74d826dc1545aa8f51b5fcbc05fcd1cc2c984) as its existing baseline. Its streaming, recovery and errata fixes are recorded separately from new work-package changes. A PR, directory or public interface does not establish package completion. Current changes still need source-specific tests, ARM, resource, SDK and documentation results. Physical boards and remote Actions are deferred at the user's request; software acceptance uses local gates."
